|---|---|
| `node tests/dataReusePerformance.test.cjs` | **49 passed, 0 failed** (was 37; +12 for the 60 s boundary, failed-refresh, in-flight-invalidation and sign-out-during-flight cases) |
| `node tests/freeCourseEnrollment.test.cjs` | 48 passed, 0 failed |
