Clicking the button still navigated back (`/lesson-editor/…` → `/course-builder/3a29a59e-…`). Regression test added: [lessonEditorBackIcon.test.cjs](tests/lessonEditorBackIcon.test.cjs) (8 checks — direction-aware glyph, no rotating transform anywhere in the file, box/hitSlop/back behaviour preserved, shared-header convention guarded). Two of its checks fail on the pre-fix code.

