/*
 * pdfium-raster-helper: renders every page of a PDF to a PNG-like raw
 * RGB file and writes a manifest. Standalone process; no PHP FFI.
 *
 * Usage:
 *   pdfium-raster-helper <input.pdf> <out_dir> <dpi> [max_pages]
 *
 * Output (inside out_dir, which must already exist):
 *   page-0001.ppm   binary P6 image per page (portable, no codec needed)
 *   manifest.txt    one line per page: index width height rotation
 *
 * Exit codes: 0 ok, 2 usage, 3 cannot open/parse PDF, 4 render/write error,
 *             5 PDFium init failure.
