I fixed the profile-picture and alignment code for the Dashboard and Main Courses Listing, and the typecheck passes. I have not checked the rendered screens in Arabic or English, so the visual result is unverified.

**1. Latest Courses (Dashboard) alignment**
- Root cause: the row in `dr-overview.tsx` had no pinned direction, so its physical order and text alignment depended on the global RTL mirror.
- Fix: the row is pinned to LTR and uses `row-reverse` when `isRTL` is true. Titles and metadata use `textAlign` from `isRTL`. The thumbnail stays on the locale's start side.

**2. Main Courses Listing alignment**
- Root cause: `DoctorCourseCard` in `courses.tsx` used a plain `row` with no locale handling, so the title and metadata did not follow the locale.
- Fix: the card row, title row and metadata row are pinned to LTR and follow `isRTL` for order. The title has `textAlign` from `isRTL`.

**3. Latest Registrations alignment**
- Root cause: the row in `dr-overview.tsx` had no `textAlign` on its text and no `direction` pin. Its code also referenced `isRTL` and `StudentAvatar` without importing or declaring them, so it could not compile.
- Fix: the row is pinned to LTR with `row-reverse` for Arabic. Name, course and date use `textAlign` from `isRTL`. `isRTL` is now read from `useTranslation()`.

**4. Missing profile pictures in Latest Registrations**
- Root cause: the dashboard row never rendered `student.avatar_url`. It drew only an initial letter. The Students page used its own `StudentAvatar` component, which reads the same `avatar_url` field from the same `get_doctor_students` RPC.
- Fix: I moved `StudentAvatar` into the new shared file `src/components/StudentAvatar.tsx`. The Students page and the dashboard both import it, so they use the same photo and fallback logic. The fallback to initials still applies when there is no URL or the image fails to load.
- I did not change any backend code. The existing RPC already returns `avatar_url`.

**Modified or created files**
- `src/components/StudentAvatar.tsx` (new)
- `src/app/(app)/(doctor)/students.tsx` (local avatar removed, now imports the shared component)
- `src/app/(app)/(doctor)/dr-overview.tsx` (alignment, avatar import, `isRTL`)
- `src/app/(app)/(doctor)/courses.tsx` (`DoctorCourseCard` alignment)

**Checks run**
- `npx tsc --noEmit -p .` exits 0.

**Not done**
- I did not render the Dashboard or Courses Listing in Arabic or English, so the alignment and avatar results are unverified on screen.
- I did not compare the Students and dashboard avatars for the same user side by side.
- The main student `CourseCard` and other screens were not changed.
- No backend files were changed, so none need deploying.
